cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "AgentLock: Tool calls limited to what the user asked for"
abstract: >-
  AgentLock compiles a user's request into a capability envelope of allowed
  tools and argument values, and enforces it at an MCP proxy so a prompt
  injection cannot widen the task.
authors:
  - family-names: Sadayamuthu
    given-names: Karthikeyan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3539-6048"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sadayamuthu/agentlock"
url: "https://openastra.org"
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - prompt injection
  - least privilege
  - MCP
  - access control
